                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8fcfd148-6ecc-3b36-80e6-b298ae601ad8",
                        "entry_id": "6cf04340-ddba-3a94-8069-8121b873739a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Verwirrung des geistigen Zustands einer Person, die durch ein starkes, (irreales), äußeres Ereignis, ihren eigenen Sinnen nicht mehr trauen mag"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2d70825a-29a2-4d3c-a259-8f2a568eb8ce",
                                "sense_id": "8fcfd148-6ecc-3b36-80e6-b298ae601ad8",
                                "text": "\"Was haben die Filme \"Fight Club\", \"Mulholland Drive\" und \"The Sixth Sense\" gemeinsam? Sie alle gehören zu einem Genre, für das Anfang der 1990er Jahre in Hollywood der Begriff \"Mindfuck\" geprägt wurde.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "52a59be0-2b84-4334-86d8-bb019efd46ed",
                                "sense_id": "8fcfd148-6ecc-3b36-80e6-b298ae601ad8",
                                "text": "„Mindfuck: Verwirrung mit Konzept. Was wäre, wenn Ihnen in diesem Moment bewusst würde, dass Sie seit einer Woche tot sind und nur mit Geistern kommunizieren. In diesen Momenten der Erkenntnis wären Sie »mindfucked«.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cf39c92d-56f8-4eea-9486-e39bd0b0dcbb",
                                "sense_id": "8fcfd148-6ecc-3b36-80e6-b298ae601ad8",
                                "text": "„Doch oft stehen sich Menschen auch bei machbaren Aktionen selbst im Weg. Schuld daran ist der »Mindfuck«.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "48f93838-df3a-4213-93ed-4f8b3cb79b49",
                                "sense_id": "8fcfd148-6ecc-3b36-80e6-b298ae601ad8",
                                "text": "„Weißt du was? Mir reicht es jetzt. Diesen Mindfuck kannst du mit jemand anderem abziehen.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a7fcd450-d201-42c0-8791-35f241121843",
                                "sense_id": "8fcfd148-6ecc-3b36-80e6-b298ae601ad8",
                                "text": "„Doch anstatt diese wohltuende, leere Weite auch innerlich zu genießen, leugnen wir sie durch einen konstanten, sinnlosen, inneren Monolog, auch genannt Mindfuck.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a288445d-9a19-462c-adaf-a06b31fe5fff",
                        "source_entry_id": "6cf04340-ddba-3a94-8069-8121b873739a",
                        "source_sense_id": "8fcfd148-6ecc-3b36-80e6-b298ae601ad8",
                        "target_lang_word": "mindfuck",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "mindfuck",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8c6f814b-c683-3b9d-9293-0b2dee742fb6",
                                        "entry_id": "00faf410-801a-387a-be93-f0980b96e162",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something that intentionally destabilizes, confuses, or manipulates the mind of another person."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang",
                                            "vulgar"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f78a11ba-03ad-4efc-8542-7b5fd5aae903",
                                                "sense_id": "8c6f814b-c683-3b9d-9293-0b2dee742fb6",
                                                "text": "The actual naked fact of Establishment power in the person of the police was a real mindfuck."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa2fa128-11de-4d7c-9541-9abf3240c91b",
                                                "sense_id": "8c6f814b-c683-3b9d-9293-0b2dee742fb6",
                                                "text": "Well, Cohaagen, I have to hand it to you. It's the best mind-fuck yet."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e370f24-fe65-4577-931f-b5a40ae74615",
                                                "sense_id": "8c6f814b-c683-3b9d-9293-0b2dee742fb6",
                                                "text": "This is a total mindfuck. I guess you know we broke up."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "23e8b1f9-a124-4822-8c86-f925ad6bfd48",
                                                "sense_id": "8c6f814b-c683-3b9d-9293-0b2dee742fb6",
                                                "text": "It's a mindfuck. It's just lasers and shit, like the haunted house in Disneyland."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2610b485-7bb9-4dc6-a6d2-2bbc58699d93",
                                                "sense_id": "8c6f814b-c683-3b9d-9293-0b2dee742fb6",
                                                "text": "The first four weeks of basic training were designed to be a total mindfuck. It started from the moment they stepped off the bus and were punished for not knowing how to stand at attention, even though they'd never been taught."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f75e2063-a92f-4e5a-9d3a-09584eab360f",
                                                "sense_id": "8c6f814b-c683-3b9d-9293-0b2dee742fb6",
                                                "text": "Trump, he observes, will “do something, and then present it the very next day as something that is going to have absolutely the opposite effect. And he knows that. It’s a mind-fuck, for want of a better term.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "mindfuck",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "042634f0-54b2-3b26-9f14-ea4ca830361b",
                                        "entry_id": "e1a07e7b-ca67-3f03-8346-93c31d31fcc9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To intentionally destabilize, confuse, or manipulate the mind of another person."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang",
                                            "vulgar"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2197e457-0dbb-48aa-9b1c-87b7bbb1e59e",
                                                "sense_id": "042634f0-54b2-3b26-9f14-ea4ca830361b",
                                                "text": "Two young Canadians get mindfucked by a giant American, but they kill him in the end and then start in on each other."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aded6868-2dfd-4c3d-8b15-290ea694202d",
                                                "sense_id": "042634f0-54b2-3b26-9f14-ea4ca830361b",
                                                "text": "In response to all of this Bavarian Illuminati paranoia, Kerry—in the midst of Garrison's probe — decided to mindfuck Garrison all the more by sending out suggesting that he (Kerry) was an agent of the Bavarian Illuminati."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "634b55c6-7ad5-47e7-bb23-efc8ca9571ae",
                                                "sense_id": "042634f0-54b2-3b26-9f14-ea4ca830361b",
                                                "text": "I hated it when other entities mindfucked me."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f414ec57-cc27-4c35-a340-a9571c66c448",
                                                "sense_id": "042634f0-54b2-3b26-9f14-ea4ca830361b",
                                                "text": "\"You sick fuck.\" Ibanez was hopping from foot to foot, and McInnis suspected she was thinking about football kicking his head. It would be an easy shot. \"We should overdose you on amnestics and push you out the front door. See how long it takes for anyone to bother trying to mindfuck you.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
